  {
   "id": "t_14147afa034e407c18da",
   "sourceHash": "14147afa034e407c18da5cd0c80d11d3f4601fcbaf3e98403b8ff3efa9a68185",
   "text": "आयुर्वेदिक उपचार या आयुर्वेदिक आवासीय कार्यक्रम क्यों चुनें?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Retreat' rendered as 'आवासीय कार्यक्रम' (residential programme) to keep the clinical register."
